    iso:hasPracticeName "Strengthen PM.BP22: Evaluate project progress with respect to the Project Plan, comparing: — actual Tasks against planned Tasks; — actual results against established project Objectives; — actual resource allocation against planned Resources; — actual cost against budget estimates; — actual time against planned schedule; — actual risk against previously identified" ;
