    iso:hasPracticeDescription "Validate and obtain approval of the Requirements Specification . Validate that Requirements Specification satisfies needs and agreed upon expectations, including the user interface usability. The results found are documented in a Validation Results and corrections are made until the document is approved by the CUS." ;
    iso:hasPracticeName "Strengthen SI.BP3: Validate and obtain approval of the Requirements Specification " ;
