    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicDetail "Presents how the project processes and activities are executed to ensure the project's successful completion and the quality of the work products to be delivered according to the schedule." ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicID "WPC.09" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicList """- Delivery Instructions
- Elements required for product release identified (i.e., hardware, software, documentation, etc.)
- Delivery requirements
- Sequential ordering of tasks to be performed
- Applicable releases identified
- Applicable media identified (e.g., paper, electronic)
- Identifies all delivered software components and work products (e.g., software user documentation) with version information
- Identify any necessary backup and recovery procedures
""" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicName "Project Plan" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicNote "Signed by customer and project manager" .

