iso:WPC.12.01 a [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty iso:isCharacteristicsOf ;
            owl:someValuesFrom iso:WorkProduct ],
        iso:WorkProductCharacteristic,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicDetail "Provides the software requirements such as functions, performance, design constraints, and attributes" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicID "WPC.12" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicList "Introduction – general description of Software and its use within the context of the Customer." ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicName "Requirement Specification" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicNote "Each requirement is identified (e.g., Req. #01), unique and it is verifiable or can be assessed." .

iso:WPC.12.02 a [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty iso:isCharacteristicsOf ;
            owl:someValuesFrom iso:WorkProduct ],
        iso:WorkProductCharacteristic,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicDetail "Provides the software requirements such as functions, performance, design constraints, and attributes" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicID "WPC.12" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicList """- Requirements description:
- Functional suitability – Degree to which a product or system provides functions that meet stated and implied needs when used under specified conditions:
o Functional completeness (i.e., degree to which the set of functions covers all the specified tasks and user objectives)
o Functional correctness (i.e., degree to which a product or system provides the correct results with the needed degree of precision)
o Functional appropriateness (i.e., degree to which the functions facilitate the accomplishment of specified tasks and objectives. As an example: a user is only presented with the necessary steps to complete a task, excluding any unnecessary steps)
- Performance efficiency - Performance relative to the amount of resources used under stated conditions (e.g., time behaviour, resource utilisation, capacity)
- Compatibility - Degree to which a product or component can exchange information with other products, systems or components, and/or perform its required functions, while sharing the same hardware or software environment (e.g., co-existence, Interoperability)
- Usability - Degree to which a product can be used by specified users to achieve specified goals with effectiveness, efficiency, and satisfaction in a specified context of use (e.g., appropriateness recognizability, learnability, operability, user error protection, user interface aesthetics, accessibility)
- Reliability – Degree to which a product or component performs specified functions under specified conditions for a specified period of time (e.g., maturity, availability, fault tolerance, recoverability)
- Maintainability – Degree of effectiveness and efficiency with which a product can be modified by the intended maintainers (e.g., modularity, reusability, analysability, modifiability, testability)
- Portability – Degree of effectiveness and efficiency with which a product, or component can be transferred from one hardware, software or other operational or usage environment to another (e.g., adaptability, instability, replaceability)
- Security - Degree to which a product protects information and data so that persons or other products or systems have the degree of data access appropriate to their types and levels of authorization (e.g., confidentiality, integrity, non-repudiation, accountability, authenticity)
- Design and construction limitations/constraints – needs imposed by the Customer
- Legal and regulative – needs imposed by laws, regulations, etc""" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicName "Requirement Specification" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicNote "Each requirement is identified (e.g., Req. #01), unique and it is verifiable or can be assessed." .

iso:WPC.13.01 a [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty iso:isCharacteristicsOf ;
            owl:someValuesFrom iso:WorkProduct ],
        iso:WorkProductCharacteristic,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicDetail "Software item (e.g., software source and executable code) for a customer, constituted by a collection of integrated software components" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicID "WPC.13" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicList "Software" ;
    iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicName "Software" .

