    iso:hasTaskDescription """Verify and obtain approval of the *software user documentation from AN:
- Verify consistency of the *software user documentation with the Requirement specification.
- Make corrections until the document is approved by AN.
- Generate the traceability record.""" ;
    iso:hasTaskID "SI.2.6" ;
    iso:hasTaskNote "NOTE 1: Conditional task. Software user documentation is verified and approved if it is listed in the delivery instructions.",
        "NOTE 2: The results of the verification are documented in the verification record.",
        "NOTE 3: Conditional task: Initiate a change request if significant changes (those affecting project delivery schedule/ project costs/ etc.) were needed.",
        "NOTE 4: The traceability record documents the links between the requirements of the agreement and software Requirement specification.",
        "NOTE 5: ISO/IEC 20246 defines different types of work product reviews." ;
    iso:isTaskOf iso:SI.ACT.02 .

